    "bio": "A Representative from Pennsylvania; born in York, York County, Pa., March 5, 1962; attended York Suburban High School, York, Pa., 1980; B.S., Shippensburg University, Shippensburg, Pa., 1984; J.D., Pepperdine University School of Law,Pepperdine University, Malibu, Calif., 1991; member of the Pennsylvania state house of representatives, 1992-2000; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred Seventh and to the five succeeding Congresses (January 3, 2001-January 3, 2013); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Thirteenth Congress in 2012; judge, Common Pleas Court, York County, Pa., nineteenth district, 2014-present.",
